The problem is that you used the same character name.  Ms. Pakka Pakka
was pissed at Odi.  Thus, when you named your next character Odi, and
the Bones files got opened, NetHack had Ms. Pakka Pakka attack Odi.

The solution:  do not name your characters the same.  If you do, you
run the risk of having this happen.
